# Projects II Game Template — Cursor Rules

Follow `AGENTS.md` in the repository root. That file is the source of truth.

Quick reminders:

- Phaser + TypeScript + Vite; Supabase for backend data
- Put Supabase calls in `src/services/`, not inside scenes
- The starter demo only proves connectivity — do not expand it into auth/accounts/game saves unless the user asks
- Never add privileged Supabase keys to client code
- Do not introduce React, Spring Boot, or Docker unless explicitly requested
